# Pin the official registry for this project.
#
# A machine-level ~/.npmrc pointing at a mirror produces a lockfile whose
# resolved URLs all point at that mirror, and whose optional platform packages
# (@emnapi/core, @emnapi/runtime) go missing. `npm ci` then fails inside the
# Linux build container even though `npm install` succeeds on the dev machine.
# Pinning here keeps the lockfile reproducible for the container and for
# anyone else cloning the repo.
registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
